        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-neutral-200"><div class="text-2xl font-black text-neutral-300 mb-2">2</div><p class="font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-1">Audit technique</p><p class="text-xs">Estimation basee sur la stack technique detectee (custom build, GTM, HTTPS).</p></div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-neutral-200"><div class="text-2xl font-black text-neutral-300 mb-2">3</div><p class="font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-1">10 personas simules</p><p class="text-xs">Profils realistes de patients nanceiens — urgences, familles, seniors, sportifs, entreprises.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA FINAL -->
  <section class="py-16 border-t border-neutral-200">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
